{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西九龍總區衝鋒隊男警昨晚在西九行動基地上彈時走火，無人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方指，該名衝鋒隊男警員昨晚11時左右，在西九龍總區衝鋒隊行動基地為配槍入彈期間懷疑走火，發射一發子彈，無人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.OPENFIRE-1200_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026bHYXeEtMqh1787719843.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.OPENFIRE-1200_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方指使用裝備有嚴格規定，事件由西九衝鋒隊跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T05:19:16.353020+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}